es can be appended but not removed. Equality"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"ignores the order of the vertices and of the hyperedges."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Maps from the vertices and the hyperedges to values can be attached ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PropertyGraph"},{"type":"text","text":"): a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"vertex map is read by vertex index or by vertex, an edge map by hyperedge position."}]}]}],"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers","title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/IncidenceList\/init()","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/IncidenceList\/init(_:)-1q4ch","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/IncidenceList\/init(_:)-5okhi","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/IncidenceList\/init(_:)-95nd3","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/IncidenceList\/init(hyperedges:)","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/IncidenceList\/init(vertices:)","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/IncidenceList\/init(vertices:hyperedges:)"]},{"generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Properties","title":"Instance Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/IncidenceList\/reversed"]},{"generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Methods","title":"Instance Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/IncidenceList\/degree(checked:)","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/IncidenceList\/inDegree(checked:)","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/IncidenceList\/inHyperedges(checked:)","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/IncidenceList\/insert(_:)","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/IncidenceList\/insert(checked:targets:)","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/IncidenceList\/insert(sources:targets:)","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergrap